{"turn_id": "d12-t2", "session_id": "d12", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "task_formulation", "text": "论文将概念识别（CR）表述为与命名实体抽取类似的 token 分类任务。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-7e9b5fdcd1b735fa2b7de65a"}]}, {"key": "model_choice", "text": "作者选择 BERT 作为语言模型，理由是其通用性以及对上下文化词嵌入的使用。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "model_setup", "text": "作者使用 BERT 的预训练 cased 语言模型做多类分类，借助 pytorch transformers 和 hugging face，采用 BertForTokenClassification；文本被嵌入为 tokens 和 masks 并设定最大 token 长度，这些嵌入输入预训练 BERT 做完整微调。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "f1_score", "text": "该微调模型在概念识别任务上取得 F1 分数 0.89。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "data_split", "text": "训练和评估采用 80-20 数据划分。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "spacy_comparison", "text": "作者还用 spaCy 实现了概念识别，其结果同样相似。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "detailed_tables", "text": "概念识别任务的详细性能展示在论文的表 2 和表 3 中。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-35ae853dec5dd79f61ef4980"}]}, {"key": "dataset_construction", "text": "在领域专家和文本处理方法的帮助下，作者构建了词级标注的数据集，通过仔细定义标注方案来训练序列模型识别系统工程概念。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2003.11687", "chunk_id": "c-7e9b5fdcd1b735fa2b7de65a"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d12-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
